  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> be the solution of the differential equation, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Then"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": true
