  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>This is a linear differential equation of the type&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;the integrating factor&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>lnsec</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>And, the general solution is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8901;</mo><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8901;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Using integration by parts in the second integral, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>sec</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8901;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8901;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>sec</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math><mi>y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Differentiating&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;with respect to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
  }
}